# CASHY environment template — copy to .env (git-ignored) only if needed.
#
# ★ CASHY requires NO environment variables to build or run.
#   It is 100% client-side (IndexedDB) and ships with NO API keys,
#   NO secrets, NO third-party service credentials.
#
# Reserved for future use (examples only — never commit real values):
#   VITE_APP_NAME=CASHY
#
# Reminder: Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to client code,
# and this repository must never contain real secrets.
